dashboardLinkReply(tailnet)
	🔗 Dashboard sign-in link, works once within 10 minutes:

	*From any device on your tailnet:*
	http://fridolin-core.example.ts.net/#login=CODE

	*On the core machine:*
	http://127.0.0.1:8765/#login=CODE

	It signs that browser in for 30 days; send `!dashboard` again for another link. Do not forward it.
dashboardLinkReply(local)
	🔗 Dashboard sign-in link, works once within 10 minutes:

	http://127.0.0.1:8765/#login=CODE

	The core is not on the tailnet, so it works only on the core machine.

	It signs that browser in for 30 days; send `!dashboard` again for another link. Do not forward it.
